# Vulnerabilities accepted after review. Trivy reads this file automatically
# because the pipeline runs trivy from the root of this repository.
# Review this list whenever Spring Boot is upgraded.

# spring-webmvc 6.2.x: RCE via XsltView. Fixed only in Spring Framework 7 (Spring Boot 4).
# Not exploitable here: the application uses Thymeleaf views only, never XsltView.
CVE-2026-47884

# spring-webmvc 6.2.x: stream corruption in Server-Sent Events with views. Fixed only in Spring Framework 7.
# Not exploitable here: the application does not use Server-Sent Events.
CVE-2026-47890
